{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't Fall \u2013 A Game of Balance and Timing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stack it. Balance it. Survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Don't Fall</i> is a fast-paced strategy and simulation game where you place objects of various sizes on a wooden shelf and fight against gravity. Your goal? Don\u2019t let anything fall. With each object added, balance becomes harder to maintain \u2014 and time is always ticking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some items come with unique effects, appearing at low probability to turn the tide or test your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple to play, hard to master.<br>Can you keep it steady until the timer runs out?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3772110?t=1748674546","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3772110?t=1748674546","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772110/591025b74def2ec5629a2614a0d8125adfed5d9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748674546","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772110/591025b74def2ec5629a2614a0d8125adfed5d9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748674546","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't Fall \u2013 A Game of Balance and Timing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stack it. Balance it. Survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Don't Fall</i> is a fast-paced strategy and simulation game where you place objects of various sizes on a wooden shelf and fight against gravity. Your goal? Don\u2019t let anything fall. With each object added, balance becomes harder to maintain \u2014 and time is always ticking.</p><p c